{
  "id": 127741685,
  "iid": 5197,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Signal-Pdu/AUTOSAR I-PduM: CAN-IDs are registered as std/ext (bugfix)",
  "description": "Instead of just assuming CAN-IDs > 0x7ff are extended, the new code\nchecks the EFF_FLAG of the CAN-ID of the Signal_PDU_Binding_CAN. This\naffects registering CAN-IDs with the CAN dissector as well as config\nlookups.\n\nThis patch changes the config format of Signal_PDU_Binding_CAN\nslightly. The CAN-ID needs to include the EFF-Flag now!",
  "state": "merged",
